  "display_title": "My Eunha",
  "description": "A devastating accident lands Eun-Ha Seo in the hospital. Mysteriously, she wakes up 12 years younger in her 22-year-old body. Life has given Eun-Ha a second chance, but this is not the life she remembers. Memories blur with reality as she navigates the unfamiliar friendships and romances of this parallel time. Like a surreal game of “what if?,” Eun-Ha is torn between the excitement of a new past and a longing for the life and love she once had. Will Eun-Ha ever find solace? Only time will tell.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
